# Internal descriptive-name outputs are reproducible duplicates. Publication
# assets with authoritative figure/panel names are tracked under figures/main,
# figures/supplementary, and figures/components.
figures/generated/
figures/archive_superseded/

# Raw experiment execution trees are large, machine-local records. The compact
# analyzed tables required by the manuscript are tracked under source_data/.
